 "answer": "The default value of `ef_construction` for HNSW indexes in pgvector is **64**.\n\nIt controls the size of the dynamic candidate list used while building the index. Higher values can improve index quality and recall at the cost of slower builds. You can override it when creating the index, for example:\n\n```sql\nCREATE INDEX ON items USING hnsw (embedding vector_l2_ops) WITH (m = 16, ef_construction = 64);\n```",
